msgctxt "116_Man"
msgid "Hey... I know some real nice gals. Wanna have some fun with 'em? I'll make it cheap, my guy."
msgstr "Oye, sé de unas chicas finas finas. ¿Quieres pasártelo bien con ellas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "128_Man"
msgid "The hell, ya doubtin' me? Don't ya fuck with me!"
msgstr "¿Te crees que te estoy tomando el pelo? ¡No juegues conmigo o te mato!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "152_Man"
msgid "Sorry... I lied about the gals. Was tryin' to trick ya and get your money..."
msgstr "Perdona... Lo de las chicas era mentira. Solo intentaba timarte y quedarme con tu dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "164_Man"
msgid "Take this... I hope ya keep quiet about this. I'm real sorry for this, my guy."
msgstr "Toma... Espero que esto lo compense. De verdad, perdón amigo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "176_Man"
msgid "You got a moldy %s."
msgstr "Obtuviste un %s."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "212_Man"
msgid "Was that not enough? Please, no more..."
msgstr "¿No fue suficiente? Por favor, ya no más..."

